---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#02050a" />
    <meta name="description" content="ISIVOLTPRO phase 3.3 system integration built on the approved Core 3.1 visual base." />
    <title>ISIVOLTPRO · Phase 3.3 System Integration</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <iframe id="core-base" src={`${base}lab-3d-phase31/`} title="IsiVoltPro approved Core 3.1 base" aria-hidden="true"></iframe>
    <canvas id="integration-webgl" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href={base}>ISIVOLT<strong>PRO</strong></a>
      <span class="phase">FASE 3.3 / SYSTEM INTEGRATION</span>
      <a class="back" href={`${base}lab-3d-phase31/`}>CORE 3.1 · APPROVED</a>
    </header>

    <aside class="metrics" aria-live="polite">
      <div><span>MECHANICAL</span><strong id="mechanical-status">LOADING</strong></div>
      <div><span>HVAC</span><strong id="hvac-status">LOADING</strong></div>
      <div><span>CLIMATE</span><strong id="climate-status">LOADING</strong></div>
      <div><span>ELECTRICAL</span><strong id="electrical-status">LOADING</strong></div>
      <div><span>CORE</span><strong>3.1</strong></div>
      <div><span>SELECTED</span><strong id="selected-system">ALL</strong></div>
      <div><span>STATE</span><strong id="selected-state">NORMAL</strong></div>
      <div><span>BASE FPS</span><strong id="base-fps">--</strong></div>
      <div><span>OVERLAY CALLS</span><strong id="calls">--</strong></div>
      <div><span>OVERLAY TRIS</span><strong id="tris">--</strong></div>
    </aside>

    <div class="system-tag" data-system="mechanical"><b>MECHANICAL</b><span>Flow · pumps · circuits</span></div>
    <div class="system-tag" data-system="hvac"><b>HVAC</b><span>Air · ventilation</span></div>
    <div class="system-tag" data-system="climate"><b>CLIMATE</b><span>Thermal equipment</span></div>
    <div class="system-tag" data-system="electrical"><b>ELECTRICAL</b><span>Power · distribution</span></div>

    <div class="state-legend" aria-hidden="true">
      <span data-state="NORMAL"><i></i>NORMAL</span>
      <span data-state="ATTENTION"><i></i>ATTENTION</span>
      <span data-state="MAINTENANCE"><i></i>MAINTENANCE</span>
      <span data-state="ALARM"><i></i>ALARM</span>
    </div>

    <main id="story">
      <section class="chapter active"><div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">ISIVOLTPRO CORE · APPROVED 3.1</p>
        <h1>One core.<br />Four real systems.</h1>
        <p class="body-copy">The Core keeps the exact 3.1 architecture you approved. Phase 3.3 gives its four existing ports an operational meaning without adding decorative hardware.</p>
        <span class="scroll-hint">FOLLOW THE SYSTEMS <i>↓</i></span>
      </div></section>

      <section class="chapter"><div class="copy right-copy">
        <p class="index">02 / MECHANICAL</p><p class="eyebrow">FLOW · PUMPS · SERVICE</p>
        <h2>Maintenance<br />has a route.</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">The mechanical port follows the real pump and pipe zone. Maintenance state uses a restrained cool-blue signal: visible to the operator, never louder than the installation.</p>
      </div></section>

      <section class="chapter"><div class="copy">
        <p class="index">03 / HVAC</p><p class="eyebrow">AIR · DUCTS · ATTENTION</p>
        <h2>Air becomes<br />operational data.</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">The HVAC route climbs toward the real overhead duct network. Attention changes the signal to amber while the Core itself remains visually stable.</p>
      </div></section>

      <section class="chapter"><div class="copy right-copy">
        <p class="index">04 / CLIMATE</p><p class="eyebrow">THERMAL EQUIPMENT · NORMAL</p>
        <h2>Equipment stays<br />connected.</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">The climate port points toward the indoor/outdoor thermal equipment chain. Normal operation is cyan and deliberately quiet.</p>
      </div></section>

      <section class="chapter"><div class="copy">
        <p class="index">05 / ELECTRICAL</p><p class="eyebrow">POWER · DISTRIBUTION · ALARM</p>
        <h2>Alarm is clear.<br />Not theatrical.</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">Electrical status reaches the distribution bay. Alarm is the only red state and appears only on the affected path, leaving the rest of the facility readable.</p>
      </div></section>

      <section class="chapter"><div class="copy end-copy">
        <p class="index">06 / CONVERGENCE</p><p class="eyebrow">SYSTEMS → CORE</p>
        <h2>Different systems.<br />One operating picture.</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">Mechanical, HVAC, climate and electrical now converge through physical ports with a common state language. This closes the Core architecture and prepares the wider IsiVoltPro ecosystem.</p>
        <a class="lab-button" href={`${base}lab-3d-phase31/`}>COMPARE WITH CORE 3.1 <span>→</span></a>
      </div></section>
    </main>

    <script>
      import * as THREE from 'three';

      type StateName = 'NORMAL' | 'ATTENTION' | 'MAINTENANCE' | 'ALARM';
      type SystemKey = 'mechanical' | 'hvac' | 'climate' | 'electrical';

      const frame = document.querySelector('#core-base');
      const canvas = document.querySelector('#integration-webgl');
      const baseFps = document.querySelector('#base-fps');
      const callsEl = document.querySelector('#calls');
      const trisEl = document.querySelector('#tris');
      const selectedSystemEl = document.querySelector('#selected-system');
      const selectedStateEl = document.querySelector('#selected-state');
      const chapters = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.chapter'));
      const labels = new Map<SystemKey, HTMLElement>();
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.system-tag').forEach((tag) => labels.set(tag.dataset.system as SystemKey, tag));

      let frameReady = false;
      if (frame instanceof HTMLIFrameElement) {
        frame.addEventListener('load', () => {
          try {
            const doc = frame.contentDocument;
            if (!doc) return;
            const style = doc.createElement('style');
            style.textContent = `
              html { scrollbar-width: none !important; }
              html::-webkit-scrollbar, body::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none !important; }
              .topbar, .metrics { visibility: hidden !important; }
              #story { opacity: 0 !important; pointer-events: none !important; }
              body::after { display: none !important; }
            `;
            doc.head.appendChild(style);
            frameReady = true;
          } catch (error) {
            console.error('Phase 3.3 approved base setup failed', error);
          }
        });
      }

      function getProgress() {
        const max = Math.max(1, document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight);
        return THREE.MathUtils.clamp(window.scrollY / max, 0, 1);
      }

      function syncBase(progress: number) {
        if (!(frame instanceof HTMLIFrameElement) || !frameReady) return;
        try {
          const win = frame.contentWindow;
          const doc = frame.contentDocument;
          if (!win || !doc) return;
          const maxScroll = Math.max(0, doc.documentElement.scrollHeight - frame.clientHeight);
          win.scrollTo(0, progress * maxScroll);
          const sourceMap: Array<[string, string]> = [
            ['pipe-status', 'mechanical-status'],
            ['hvac-status', 'hvac-status'],
            ['aircon-status', 'climate-status'],
            ['electrical-status', 'electrical-status'],
          ];
          sourceMap.forEach(([sourceId, targetId]) => {
            const source = doc.querySelector(`#${sourceId}`);
            const target = document.querySelector(`#${targetId}`);
            if (source && target) target.textContent = source.textContent || 'LOADING';
          });
          const sourceFps = doc.querySelector('#fps');
          if (sourceFps && baseFps) baseFps.textContent = sourceFps.textContent || '--';
        } catch (error) {
          console.error('Phase 3.3 base sync failed', error);
          frameReady = false;
        }
      }

      const supportsWebGL = (() => {
        try {
          const test = document.createElement('canvas');
          return Boolean(test.getContext('webgl2') || test.getContext('webgl'));
        } catch { return false; }
      })();

      if (supportsWebGL && canvas instanceof HTMLCanvasElement) {
        const mobile = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)').matches;
        const reducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false, powerPreference: 'high-performance', stencil: false });
        renderer.setClearColor(0x000000, 0);
        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, mobile ? 1.0 : 1.25));
        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);
        renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;
        renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;
        renderer.toneMappingExposure = 0.92;
        renderer.shadowMap.enabled = false;

        const scene = new THREE.Scene();
        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 160);
        camera.position.set(-17, 8.5, 20);

        const depthOnly = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ colorWrite: false, depthWrite: true, depthTest: true });
        const coreMask = new THREE.Group();
        coreMask.position.set(0, 0.14, 0.2);
        scene.add(coreMask);
        const maskFoot = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(2.45, 2.7, 0.22, 8), depthOnly); maskFoot.position.y = 0.11; coreMask.add(maskFoot);
        const maskRing = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(2.2, 2.38, 0.36, 8), depthOnly); maskRing.position.y = 0.4; coreMask.add(maskRing);
        const maskDeck = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.92, 2.08, 0.18, 8), depthOnly); maskDeck.position.y = 0.67; coreMask.add(maskDeck);
        const maskChamber = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.94, 0.94, 3.38, 24), depthOnly); maskChamber.position.y = 2.78; coreMask.add(maskChamber);
        const maskCrown = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.55, 1.72, 0.78, 8), depthOnly); maskCrown.position.y = 5.02; coreMask.add(maskCrown);

        const stateColors: Record<StateName, number> = {
          NORMAL: 0x00d9ff,
          ATTENTION: 0xffb238,
          MAINTENANCE: 0x4b8cff,
          ALARM: 0xff4b45,
        };

        const specs: Array<{ key: SystemKey; name: string; start: THREE.Vector3; target: THREE.Vector3; height: number }> = [
          { key: 'mechanical', name: 'MECHANICAL', start: new THREE.Vector3(-1.62, 1.06, -0.18), target: new THREE.Vector3(-6, 1.2, -4.4), height: 1.0 },
          { key: 'hvac', name: 'HVAC', start: new THREE.Vector3(0.55, 1.06, 1.72), target: new THREE.Vector3(3.6, 4.7, 3.25), height: 1.55 },
          { key: 'climate', name: 'CLIMATE', start: new THREE.Vector3(1.62, 1.06, 0.58), target: new THREE.Vector3(9.2, 1.2, 1.7), height: 1.24 },
          { key: 'electrical', name: 'ELECTRICAL', start: new THREE.Vector3(0.38, 1.06, -1.42), target: new THREE.Vector3(8.8, 1.4, -7.5), height: 1.36 },
        ];

        const integration = specs.map((spec, index) => {
          const mid = spec.start.clone().lerp(spec.target, 0.5); mid.y += spec.height;
          const curve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3([spec.start, mid, spec.target]);
          const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: stateColors.NORMAL, transparent: true, opacity: 0.24, depthTest: true, depthWrite: false });
          const line = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TubeGeometry(curve, 28, 0.018, 6, false), material);
          scene.add(line);

          const portMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: stateColors.NORMAL, transparent: true, opacity: 0.55, depthTest: true, depthWrite: false });
          const portRing = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.19, 0.018, 6, 28), portMaterial);
          portRing.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;
          portRing.position.copy(spec.start);
          scene.add(portRing);

          const targetRing = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.31, 0.022, 6, 32), portMaterial.clone());
          targetRing.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;
          targetRing.position.copy(spec.target);
          scene.add(targetRing);

          const pulseMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: stateColors.NORMAL, transparent: true, opacity: 0.92, depthTest: true, depthWrite: false });
          const pulse = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.065, 9, 9), pulseMaterial);
          scene.add(pulse);
          const echo = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.035, 7, 7), pulseMaterial.clone());
          scene.add(echo);

          return { ...spec, curve, material, portMaterial, portRing, targetRing, pulseMaterial, pulse, echo, offset: index * 0.19 };
        });

        const cameraPath = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3([
          new THREE.Vector3(-16, 8, 19), new THREE.Vector3(-10, 4.5, 8), new THREE.Vector3(-5.8, 2.6, 3.4),
          new THREE.Vector3(-3.1, 2.2, 2.3), new THREE.Vector3(2.8, 2.35, 2.7), new THREE.Vector3(3.8, 3.5, -0.5),
          new THREE.Vector3(2.4, 4.9, -3.5), new THREE.Vector3(-1.9, 5.8, -3.2), new THREE.Vector3(-5.5, 4.6, 1.3),
          new THREE.Vector3(-1.8, 3.6, 5.3), new THREE.Vector3(5.8, 6.2, 10.5),
        ]);
        const targetPath = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3([
          new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.6, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.6, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.5, 0.2),
          new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.5, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.8, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.9, 0.2),
          new THREE.Vector3(0, 3.2, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 3.3, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.7, 0.2),
          new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.7, 0.2), new THREE.Vector3(0, 2.8, 0.2),
        ]);

        const chapterModes: Array<{ system: SystemKey | null; state: StateName }> = [
          { system: null, state: 'NORMAL' },
          { system: 'mechanical', state: 'MAINTENANCE' },
          { system: 'hvac', state: 'ATTENTION' },
          { system: 'climate', state: 'NORMAL' },
          { system: 'electrical', state: 'ALARM' },
          { system: null, state: 'NORMAL' },
        ];

        let activeChapter = -1;
        let currentMode = chapterModes[0];

        function setMode(index: number) {
          const next = chapterModes[Math.min(chapterModes.length - 1, Math.max(0, index))];
          currentMode = next;
          if (selectedSystemEl) selectedSystemEl.textContent = next.system ? next.system.toUpperCase() : 'ALL';
          if (selectedStateEl) selectedStateEl.textContent = next.state;
          chapters.forEach((chapter, chapterIndex) => chapter.classList.toggle('active', chapterIndex === index));
          document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.state-legend span').forEach((item) => item.classList.toggle('active', item.dataset.state === next.state));
          labels.forEach((label, key) => {
            label.classList.toggle('selected', next.system === key);
            label.classList.toggle('overview', next.system === null);
          });
        }

        function updateSignals(elapsed: number) {
          integration.forEach((connection, index) => {
            const selected = currentMode.system === connection.key;
            const overview = currentMode.system === null;
            const state = selected ? currentMode.state : 'NORMAL';
            const color = stateColors[state];
            connection.material.color.setHex(color);
            connection.portMaterial.color.setHex(color);
            (connection.targetRing.material as THREE.MeshBasicMaterial).color.setHex(color);
            connection.pulseMaterial.color.setHex(color);
            (connection.echo.material as THREE.MeshBasicMaterial).color.setHex(color);

            connection.material.opacity = selected ? 0.78 : overview ? 0.3 : 0.075;
            connection.portMaterial.opacity = selected ? 0.9 : overview ? 0.5 : 0.16;
            (connection.targetRing.material as THREE.MeshBasicMaterial).opacity = selected ? 0.86 : overview ? 0.44 : 0.12;
            connection.pulseMaterial.opacity = selected ? 1 : overview ? 0.68 : 0.16;
            (connection.echo.material as THREE.MeshBasicMaterial).opacity = selected ? 0.72 : overview ? 0.4 : 0.08;

            const speed = selected ? 0.15 : 0.075;
            const t = (elapsed * speed + connection.offset) % 1;
            connection.pulse.position.copy(connection.curve.getPointAt(t));
            connection.echo.position.copy(connection.curve.getPointAt((t + 0.18) % 1));
            const scale = selected ? 1 + Math.sin(elapsed * 3.1 + index) * 0.2 : 0.78;
            connection.targetRing.scale.setScalar(scale);
            connection.portRing.scale.setScalar(selected ? 1.13 : 1);
          });
        }

        function updateLabels() {
          integration.forEach((connection) => {
            const label = labels.get(connection.key);
            if (!label) return;
            const point = connection.target.clone().add(new THREE.Vector3(0, 0.58, 0));
            point.project(camera);
            const visible = point.z > -1 && point.z < 1;
            const x = (point.x * 0.5 + 0.5) * window.innerWidth;
            const y = (-point.y * 0.5 + 0.5) * window.innerHeight;
            label.style.transform = `translate(-50%, -50%) translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;
            label.style.visibility = visible ? 'visible' : 'hidden';
          });
        }

        const clock = new THREE.Clock();
        let raf = 0;
        let visible = true;
        function render() {
          const elapsed = clock.getElapsedTime();
          const progress = reducedMotion ? 0.88 : THREE.MathUtils.clamp(getProgress(), 0.001, 0.999);
          const chapter = Math.min(chapters.length - 1, Math.floor(progress * chapters.length));
          if (chapter !== activeChapter) {
            activeChapter = chapter;
            setMode(chapter);
          }

          syncBase(progress);
          camera.position.lerp(cameraPath.getPointAt(progress), reducedMotion ? 1 : 0.065);
          camera.lookAt(targetPath.getPointAt(progress));
          updateSignals(elapsed);
          updateLabels();
          renderer.render(scene, camera);
          if (callsEl) callsEl.textContent = renderer.info.render.calls.toLocaleString();
          if (trisEl) trisEl.textContent = renderer.info.render.triangles.toLocaleString();
          if (visible) raf = requestAnimationFrame(render);
        }

        function resize() {
          camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;
          camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
          renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, mobile ? 1.0 : 1.25));
          renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight, false);
        }
        window.addEventListener('resize', resize, { passive: true });
        document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
          visible = !document.hidden;
          if (visible) {
            cancelAnimationFrame(raf);
            clock.getDelta();
            render();
          }
        });
        setMode(0);
        render();
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; color: #fff; background: #02050a; color-scheme: dark; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; background: #02050a; overflow-x: hidden; }
  body { min-width: 320px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  #core-base, #integration-webgl { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; }
  #core-base { z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; background: #02050a; }
  #integration-webgl { z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; }
  body::after { content: ''; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 3; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(2,5,10,.54), transparent 35%, transparent 68%, rgba(2,5,10,.37)), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,5,10,.12), transparent 54%, rgba(2,5,10,.57)); }
  .topbar { position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto; z-index: 30; height: 74px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; padding: 0 clamp(22px, 4.5vw, 74px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(125,187,211,.1); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,5,10,.82), rgba(2,5,10,.06)); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .brand { justify-self: start; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .brand strong { color: #00dcff; }
  .phase, .back { color: #8aa0ae; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .back { justify-self: end; }
  .metrics { position: fixed; z-index: 28; right: clamp(22px, 3vw, 48px); top: 96px; width: 210px; padding: 10px 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(126,187,211,.12); background: rgba(3,8,13,.62); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .metrics div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(126,187,211,.07); }
  .metrics div:last-child { border: 0; }
  .metrics span, .metrics strong { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .metrics span { color: #667e8c; }
  .metrics strong { color: #00d9ff; }
  #story { position: relative; z-index: 5; }
  .chapter { min-height: 100vh; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 100px clamp(26px, 6vw, 104px) 60px; pointer-events: none; }
  .copy { width: min(660px, 48vw); opacity: .13; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .5s ease, transform .5s ease; }
  .chapter.active .copy { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .right-copy { margin-left: auto; width: min(590px, 44vw); }
  .end-copy { width: min(760px, 68vw); }
  .eyebrow, .index { margin: 0 0 14px; color: #00d9ff; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .22em; }
  .index { color: #657c89; }
  h1, h2 { margin: 0; font-weight: 510; letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: .91; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(54px, 7vw, 118px); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 98px); }
  .body-copy { max-width: 530px; margin: 24px 0 0; color: #93a5af; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .scroll-hint { display: inline-flex; gap: 13px; margin-top: 34px; color: #6f8591; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .scroll-hint i { color: #00d9ff; font-style: normal; }
  .lab-button { pointer-events: auto; display: inline-flex; gap: 18px; margin-top: 30px; padding: 13px 17px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,217,255,.27); color: #dffaff; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .lab-button span { color: #00d9ff; }
  .system-tag { position: fixed; left: 0; top: 0; z-index: 18; min-width: 126px; padding: 7px 9px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(0,217,255,.28); background: rgba(2,7,11,.5); opacity: .2; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity .3s ease, border-color .3s ease, background .3s ease; }
  .system-tag b, .system-tag span { display: block; }
  .system-tag b { color: #cdeaf1; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .system-tag span { margin-top: 3px; color: #6f8591; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .system-tag.selected { opacity: 1; border-color: rgba(0,217,255,.8); background: rgba(2,9,14,.76); }
  .system-tag.overview { opacity: .58; }
  .state-legend { position: fixed; z-index: 28; right: clamp(22px, 3vw, 48px); bottom: 28px; display: flex; gap: 13px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(126,187,211,.1); background: rgba(3,8,13,.58); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .state-legend span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: #566e7a; font-size: 7px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; opacity: .45; }
  .state-legend span.active { color: #c9e5ed; opacity: 1; }
  .state-legend i { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00d9ff; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,217,255,.3); }
  .state-legend [data-state="ATTENTION"] i { background: #ffb238; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,178,56,.3); }
  .state-legend [data-state="MAINTENANCE"] i { background: #4b8cff; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(75,140,255,.3); }
